sequenceDiagram
    actor T as Traveler
    participant B as Browser
    participant C as ItineraryItemController
    participant NS as NearestNeighborSorter
    participant DS as DistanceService
    participant DB as MySQL

    T->>B: Klik 'Urutkan Otomatis' pada satu hari
    B->>C: POST day_number
    C->>DB: ambil itinerary_items hari itu + destination
    DB-->>C: koleksi item
    C->>NS: sort(items)
    loop selama item tersisa > 0
        NS->>DS: haversineKm(titik saat ini, tiap item tersisa)
        DS-->>NS: jarak
        NS->>NS: pilih item berjarak terdekat
    end
    NS-->>C: koleksi item terurut
    C->>DB: UPDATE sort_order tiap item
    C-->>B: redirect back + flash status
    B-->>T: Tampilkan urutan kunjungan baru
